{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619040/extras/SRLibraryHeroDesc.png?t=1741910828\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STRAP IN, PILOT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have one goal: Annihilate as many waves as you can!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the pilot of the <strong>SANDRIPPER</strong>, a <strong>dual-wielding hover tank.</strong> Push your<strong> nuclear engine</strong> to its melting point as you <strong>rip</strong> through wave after wave of a ruthless planetary invasion force. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619040/extras/weaponShowcase-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1741910828\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPERIMENTAL FUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Randomized waves, upgrades, and a partially destructible map create unpredictability to take advantage of. Unlock <strong>MULTI-FUNCTION</strong> weapons to pair with upgrades and create the perfect annihilation machine.  Every gun has a unique purpose!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even your <strong>ENGINE</strong> is a weapon!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619040/extras/dumpShowcase-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1741910828\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TWO DIFFERENT GAME MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ENDLESS MODE: </strong>High-stakes wave survival. Find new weapons, upgrade your Sandripper, and bend the enemy to your will until the very sand beneath your feet turns to glass. Each day also has a new <strong>online leaderboard</strong>, and a new chance beat your friends!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SEEDED CHALLENGE MODE:</strong> If you don't fancy randomness, every few days a new shared run is generated for all players to experience and master. An insane predetermined sequence of events with its own leaderboard to climb!   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619040/extras/t-ezgif.com-optimize_1_.gif?t=1741910828\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TRY, DIE, REPEAT.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Hone your skills, unlock weapons, and discover new strategies with each sub-20 minute long attempt. Gradually increasing your skill until you become a <strong>master of OBLITERATION</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619040/extras/SRSteamImage1.png?t=1741910828\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Gave it a shot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2619040/7bcd5bdae55280ed62fe7eed3363eff62bbb247f.jpg"},{"name":"Bytor and the Sand Dog","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2619040/7bcd5bdae55280ed62fe7eed3363eff62bbb247f.jpg"},{"name":"Death from above","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2619040/7bcd5bdae55280ed62fe7eed3363eff62bbb247f.jpg"},{"name":"LISAN AL GAIB!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2619040/7bcd5bdae55280ed62fe7eed3363eff62bbb247f.jpg"},{"name":"Don't close the coffin yet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2619040/7bcd5bdae55280ed62fe7eed3363eff62bbb247f.jpg"},{"name":"HYPER CALAMITY INDUCER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2619040/7bcd5bdae55280ed62fe7eed3363eff62bbb247f.jpg"},{"name":"Ok that one didnt count","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2619040/7bcd5bdae55280ed62fe7eed3363eff62bbb247f.jpg"},{"name":"CHAOS AGENT","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2619040/7bcd5bdae5